    "The initial standalone native loss is retained. The shipped default avoids that Arrow round trip. Reproduce its native behavior with unnest.standaloneNative=true, which sets streamfusion.dropUpdateBefore.standalone.enabled=true.",
    "Initial standalone results used the same production filter before the default standalone gate was added; the query, data and resources were unchanged.",
    "Candidate and prior phases each retain their own paired stock controls. Their JVM and startup variability is visible in the individual trials; short-job differences are not claims of isolated kernel throughput.",
    "Two additional profiled jobs are diagnostics only and are recorded separately; their elapsed times are excluded here.",
    "The committed fixture was formatted after timing; timed_fixture_sha256 records the measured source, and fixture_sha256 records the formatted source. Only whitespace and equivalent string-literal wrapping changed."
